    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1132830/extras/ed24d54b1e7e6590f45bea7f6fd5b615.avif?t=1684861792\" /></div><br><br>Poppy's Nightmare is a 2D side-scroller shoot'em up where a little girl fights her nightmares!<br><br>In Poppy, there is a progressive evolution of the things you can do throughout the game. You will travel marvelous worlds full of charming creatures who scare you that you are to fight. There are many of them! Spiders, dogs, dogs with planes, more spiders\u2026 but you, a girl who\u2019s fighting her nightmares, have a much stronger desire to overcome. There are also a final challenge throughout the levels and scenarios that will set ready your skills, using all of your abilities, upgrades, and skills in order to advance and collect as many points as possible, which are features in the best form possible: Candy!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1132830/extras/a40fc13b180859695c853dd6bb194d1f.avif?t=1684861792\" /></div><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A journey full of emotion and colorful art:</h2></strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1132830/extras/33afec4962c2f80b2f149c8884fa3db3.poster.avif?t=1684861792\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1132830/extras/33afec4962c2f80b2f149c8884fa3db3.webm?t=1684861792\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1132830/extras/33afec4962c2f80b2f149c8884fa3db3.mp4?t=1684861792\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Pace and difficulty will ramp up with your skills:</h2></strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1132830/extras/5666010d18932f4de71b64d200ca3f36.poster.avif?t=1684861792\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1132830/extras/5666010d18932f4de71b64d200ca3f36.webm?t=1684861792\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1132830/extras/5666010d18932f4de71b64d200ca3f36.mp4?t=1684861792\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Be careful! Don\u00b4t miss any candy:</h2></strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1132830/extras/6cad52720c431a1b91bf7f59f77498fa.poster.avif?t=1684861792\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1132830/extras/6cad52720c431a1b91bf7f59f77498fa.webm?t=1684861792\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1132830/extras/6cad52720c431a1b91bf7f59f77498fa.mp4?t=1684861792\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Phenomenal game to play for all ages:</h2></strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1132830/extras/024d5a6ce4491a1c24ac3687483d0967.poster.avif?t=1684861792\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1132830/extras/024d5a6ce4491a1c24ac3687483d0967.webm?t=1684861792\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1132830/extras/024d5a6ce4491a1c24ac3687483d0967.mp4?t=1684861792\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.